    sa: ["What does Scripture teach about the unseen world and our strength?", ["spiritual", "unseen", "lord", "strength", "enemy", "greater"], "A good answer says there is a real spiritual world with real opposition, but God's power is greater, and believers are strong in the Lord and not in themselves."],
